ExampleLoom includes modified source from moonbitlang/regexp 0.3.7.
Upstream: https://github.com/moonbitlang/regexp.mbt
Package: https://download.mooncakes.io/user/moonbitlang/regexp/0.3.7.zip
Package SHA-256: 533f0af3129ccbdb43900cd1f59d9bbb54284e0f08c410c8cf864051161958cc
Copyright 2025 International Digital Economy Academy.
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (moonbit-regexp.LICENSE).

Included production parser, AST compiler, Unicode tables and VM files are under
internal/regexp/. Original headers are retained. Local module import paths are
adjusted. ExampleLoom changes add lookahead and fixed scalar-width lookbehind,
absolute-position matching, a shared runtime budget and live-thread bound,
capture reset on repetition, hexadecimal escapes and defensive validation.
Unicode word-boundary inspection handles surrogate offsets without panicking.
This is a modified regex subsystem, not an original regex algorithm, a full
PCRE implementation, or a claim to implement every ECMAScript regex rule.
The remaining ExampleLoom search, expressions, recipes, table operators,
workbench and CLI continue under the project's MIT license.
